release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5854489Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5860368Z ^[[0m
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5860554Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5860769Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5860875Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5860968Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5861187Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5861331Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5861422Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5861681Z    if you are ready to continue.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5861813Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5862078Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5862449Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5862654Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5862889Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863016Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863147Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863342Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863488Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863777Z    can use Nix.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863875Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5863952Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5864068Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5864427Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5864771Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5870857Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5871200Z I will:
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5871322Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5871469Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5871808Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5872123Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5872393Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5872536Z  - install Nix in /nix
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5872668Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5872859Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5873041Z    /root
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5882635Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5882930Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5892646Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5892921Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5893052Z 
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5894560Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5894828Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
