release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5918509Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
release / publish	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-07T05:26:45.5919072Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
